[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4022474355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117100#issuecomment-4022474355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117100","id":4022474355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vwhZz","user":{"login":"rinevard","id":136295900,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB-13A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136295900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard","html_url":"https://github.com/rinevard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T09:45:09Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T11:49:04Z","body":"I believe the cause of this issue is `if (ap && editor->can_add_reset_key() && animation != ap->get_animation(SceneStringName(RESET)))` in `animation_track_editor.cpp` evalutes to `false`. The reason is that in `AnimationTrackEditor::can_add_reset_key`, `selection` is evaluated as empty when we do a right-click the first time, while subsequent right-clicks evaluate it to non-empty.\n\nWhen we do right-click, `bool selected = _try_select_at_ui_pos(...)` is executed, which emit the signal \"select_key\". The signal is connected to `AnimationTrackEditor::_key_selected` and `_key_selected` is called next frame since the connection is a `CONNECT_DEFERRED` connection, which causes the late update of `selection`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4022474355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023536212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117100#issuecomment-4023536212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117100","id":4023536212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v0kpU","user":{"login":"rinevard","id":136295900,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB-13A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136295900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard","html_url":"https://github.com/rinevard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T12:51:43Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T12:51:43Z","body":"And I think there's another bug here. If we left-click a valid key (which is allowed to be sent to RESET) and then right-click a invalid key (which is NOT allowed to be sent to RESET, for example a key on an audio track), the menu would mistakenly contain the option \"Send key to RESET\". This is caused by the outdated information `can_add_reset_key` relis on just like this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023536212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4024233380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117100#issuecomment-4024233380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117100","id":4024233380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v3O2k","user":{"login":"rinevard","id":136295900,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB-13A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136295900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard","html_url":"https://github.com/rinevard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T14:35:15Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T14:35:15Z","body":"I'm wondering which approach would be better: \n(1) computing the \"active selection for the next frame\" locally before building the menu, or \n(2) extracting the menu popup logic into a separate function and calling it via call_deferred (so the selection is already updated by then). \nOr is there a better approach?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4024233380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4025985776","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117100#issuecomment-4025985776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117100","id":4025985776,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v96rw","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T18:48:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T18:49:53Z","body":"Either option is acceptable. If there are no side effects and Option 2's changes is fewer than Option 1, then Option 2 is preferable.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4025985776/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]